# --- Heavy source generation stills (~40 MB each, ~1.8 GB total) ---
# These are the raw Higgsfield generation PNGs. The shipping pages render from the
# .webm / .webp / .jpg derivatives, NOT these. They are archival source only and are
# already cloud-backed via OneDrive, so they are kept OUT of git history to avoid bloat.
# (Internal contact-sheet/review pages reference them and will show broken thumbs from a
#  clean checkout — that is expected; view those locally where the source files exist.)
assets/layer-*.png
assets/seasons/**/*.png
assets/scenes/**/*.png
assets/brothers/window-*.png
assets/preservation/**/*.png

# keep the web-optimized derivatives that pages actually load
!assets/**/web/**
!assets/**/thumbs/**

# local verification artifacts
_skirmish-corner.png
_sig-test.png

# ffmpeg scratch
assets/**/_work/
